source: crates/cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: help
---
Inspect and edit layered configuration

Usage: rslbp config <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show  Show the effective merged configuration and contributing sources
  get   Show one resolved configuration key and its provenance
  set   Write a non-secret configuration value while preserving TOML comments
  path  Show the active configuration file path and whether it exists
  init  Create or update the configuration file via guided prompts
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
